"The Artonan House of Healing in Chicago treats injuries caused by superpowers."
"It is staffed by one healer, an apprentice or two and a small handful of human nurses."
"Its nurses train for years and are granted authority to use certain healing wordchains."
"It feels soothing in a way a mundane hospital never could."
"Its rooms are gold-lit, with beds of branches and screens."
"Leah Thorn had just started there as a consecrated nurse when she died."
"Alden's broken arm and wrist were mended there after the Body Drainer attack."
"Leah and Alden wrapped gifts together for its gift bowl."
"The Artonan wizard Rynez-yt runs it, a morose healer with a dreadful bedside manner."
"Rynez-yt was Leah Thorn's boss and healed Alden after the Body Drainer attack."
